ole and raised as a toy-making elf by Santa's helpers. But as he grows into adulthood, he can't shake the nagging feeling that he doesn't belong. Buddy vows to visit Manhattan and find his real dad, a workaholic.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":508965,\"title\":\"Klaus\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q125RHUDgR4gjwh1QkfYuJLYkL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cYQvXNPZLow73lhspVQ7CYlT3Mi.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A selfish postman and a reclusive toymaker form an unlikely friendship, delivering joy to a cold, dark town that desperately needs it.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":527435,\"title\":\"The Christmas Chronicles\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5Il2EMSF2KecrUKZPuen6BZmaCP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zQVsXIPXU040BnFtBmzoOfYGcDu.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Siblings Kate and Teddy try to prove Santa Claus is real, but when they accidentally cause his sleigh to crash, they have to save Christmas.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":51052,\"title\":\"Arthur Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/brELZkSbkLrcCXJ0xt5hQUMXhut.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hwtYE4Gs0IsBnrJ0nTZItOXlz19.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"For hundreds of years, the Claus family has delegated the title \\\"Santa\\\" to a chosen few of its members, which can be passed down upon retirement. Each Christmas, Santa and his vast army of highly trained elves produce gifts and distribute them around the world in a one-night high-tech operation. However, when one of 600 million children to receive a gift from Santa on Christmas Eve is missed, it is deemed ‘acceptable’ to all but one—Arthur Claus, the current Santa’s misfit son deemed ineligible for the title, who executes an unauthorised rookie mission to get the last present halfway around the globe before dawn on Christmas morning.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Animation\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13673,\"title\":\"Christmas with the Kranks\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q866vL3KhAjbkZH1enT7AoxmRHx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lcFar2tdF9Lir12R0K3Dvw6uABu.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When their only daughter Blair leaves the family nest, Luther and Nora Krank decide to book an island cruise to beat the yuletide blues and just skip the holidays. But their decision to boycott tradition has the whole neighborhood in an uproar, and when Blair calls on Christmas Eve to announce a surprise visit with her new fiancée, the Kranks have just twelve hours to perform a miracle and pull themselves and their neighbors together to throw the best celebration ever!\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":654974,\"title\":\"Home Sweet Home Alone\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fP3VvqUjEBjawxZHL4sYCq2ZdJD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a8tH0jl37366bLVyPB08dncgqqd.jpg\",\"rating\":4.8,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After being left at home by himself for the holidays, 10-year-old Max Mercer must work to defend his home from a married couple who tries to steal back a valuable heirloom.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12536,\"title\":\"Home Alone 4\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qRktvMOO2QaCL7gvNyvZDoxPOZj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/171wf8HVXZAIScPf9zJyrXpxgRB.jpg\",\"rating\":4.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Kevin McCallister's parents have split up. Now living with his mom, he decides to spend Christmas with his dad at the mansion of his father's rich girlfriend, Natalie. Meanwhile robber Marv Merchants, one of the villains from the first two movies, partners up with a new criminal named Vera to hit Natalie's mansion.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13394,\"title\":\"Shrek the Halls\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nBfeTZ5ftAbkZXCnGMaCsiA3vOa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5lUaKCo9ypmXbuVeZqKQ9gm8zk4.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Christmas tree isn't the only thing green in this new holiday classic. Shrek is back and trying to get into the spirit of the season. After promising Fiona and the kids a Christmas they'll remember, he is forced to take a crash course in the holiday. But just when he thinks he has everything for their quiet family Christmas just right, there is a knock at the door.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":645757,\"title\":\"That Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uR3uhztTAxGGK7Co0yyxVy4Gc7H.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1rpyQcniNIJgsE0wKLOqPk2n7b7.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It's an unforgettable Christmas for the townsfolk of Wellington-on-Sea when the worst snowstorm in history alters everyone's plans — including Santa's.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":478587,\"title\":\"Sinterklaas and the Golden Horseshoe\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z4GTxIObR2m3BiQt16UuOC7B22v.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/humq71tbIr0TIBvnnJJR9a0BxXo.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ten-year-old Bloem is completely crazy about Sinterklaas' horse. After several attempts, she finally convinces Sinterklaas to let her ride his horse, but then something terrible happens. During a ride outside the castle, Amerigo loses his magic horseshoe. Sinterklaas' horse does not have normal horseshoes, but one golden horseshoe. Without this magical horseshoe, Amerigo cannot climb onto the roofs. Sinterklaas does not want to worry his helpers and starts a search together with Bloem. Will they find the horseshoe in time, or will this year's gift-giving evening have to be canceled?\",\"genres\":[\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"wsUQ7acBEcQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"v2-Co3QUJdQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"qw_lQYrDJkU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}